{
    "title": "ZION Blue - digital watch face",
    "description": "Presenting a free version of \"ZION\", an elegant minimalist masterpiece - <b>ZION Blue</b>!\r\n\r\n<b>ZION Blue</b> is a highly simplistic watch face with a design focused on pure clarity and minimalism, while still offering great usability and functionality! \r\n\r\n<b>Tap the left screen edge to hide or show the edge indicators</b> if you prefer to keep everything as simple as possible! \r\n\r\nNow updated to support <b>Google\u2019s Watch Face Format</b> - offering new customization options and useful features!\r\n\r\n\r\n<b><u>Paid version with customizable colors</u> is also available:</b>\r\nhttps://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.watchfacestudio.zion\r\n\r\n\r\n<b>Made only for Wear OS - <u>Wear OS 3.0 and newer (API 30+)</u></b>\r\n<u>Please install only to your watch device.</u>\r\nPhone companion app serves only to help direct installation to your watch device. \r\n\r\n\r\n<b><font color=\"#00E8AD\">FEATURES:</font></b>\r\n- <b>Digital clock</b> - 12h/24h\r\n\u2003- TAP center or Minutes for Custom app shortcuts\r\n- <b>Month and Date</b> - Multi-language support\r\n\u2003- TAP to open Calendar\r\n- <b>Weekday</b> - Multi-language support\r\n\u2003- TAP to open Alarm\r\n- <b>Daily steps goal % bar</b> - Syncs with the health app\r\n\u2003- TAP to open Steps\r\n- <b>Battery % bar<b> \r\n\u2003- TAP to open Battery info\r\n- <b>Battery and Steps can be hidden<b> \r\n\u2003- TAP left screen edge (\"9 o'clock\") to hide/show\r\n- <b>2 Custom app shortcuts</b> - Hidden\r\n\u2003- Center of the watch face and Minutes\r\n- <b>Battery efficient AOD</b> - Customizable\r\n\u2003- Averaging just 2.5% - 4.5% active pixels\r\n\r\n- <b>Long-press to access <u>Customize menu</u></b>:\r\n\u2003\u2003- Seconds Brightness - 6 levels\r\n\u2003\u2003- Index styles - 4 different styles\r\n\u2003\u2003- AOD Cover - 4 cover options\r\n\u2003\u2003- Complications\r\n\u2003\u2003\u2003 - 2 Custom app shortcuts\r\n\r\n\r\n<b><font color=\"#00E8AD\">INSTALLATION TIPS:</font></b>\r\n<b>https://www.enkeidesignstudio.com/how-to-install</b>\r\n\r\n\r\n<b><font color=\"#00E8AD\">CONTACT:</font></b>\r\n<b>info@enkeidesignstudio.com</b>\r\n\r\nE-mail us for any questions, issues or general feedback. <b>We're here for you!</b>\r\nCustomer satisfaction is our main priority, we make sure to respond to each e-mail within <b>24 hours</b>. \r\n\r\n\r\n<b>More watch faces:</b>\r\nhttps://play.google.com/store/apps/dev?id=5744222018477253424\r\n\r\n<b>Website:</b>\r\nhttps://www.enkeidesignstudio.com\r\n\r\n<b>Social media:</b>\r\nhttps://www.facebook.com/enkei.design.studio\r\nhttps://www.instagram.com/enkeidesign\r\n\r\n\r\n<b>This free version of ZION is also available in Samsung Galaxy Store, for older Samsung Galaxy Watch devices running Tizen OS:</b>\r\nhttps://galaxy.store/ZIONfree\r\n\r\n\r\nThank you for using our watch faces.\r\nHave a great day!</b></b></b></b>",
    "descriptionHTML": "Presenting a free version of &quot;ZION&quot;, an elegant minimalist masterpiece - <b>ZION Blue</b>!<br><br><b>ZION Blue</b> is a highly simplistic watch face with a design focused on pure clarity and minimalism, while still offering great usability and functionality! <br><br><b>Tap the left screen edge to hide or show the edge indicators</b> if you prefer to keep everything as simple as possible! <br><br>Now updated to support <b>Google\u2019s Watch Face Format</b> - offering new customization options and useful features!<br><br><br><b><u>Paid version with customizable colors</u> is also available:</b><br>https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.watchfacestudio.zion<br><br><br><b>Made only for Wear OS - <u>Wear OS 3.0 and newer (API 30+)</u></b><br><u>Please install only to your watch device.</u><br>Phone companion app serves only to help direct installation to your watch device. <br><br><br><b><font color=\"#00E8AD\">FEATURES:</font></b><br>- <b>Digital clock</b> - 12h/24h<br>\u2003- TAP center or Minutes for Custom app shortcuts<br>- <b>Month and Date</b> - Multi-language support<br>\u2003- TAP to open Calendar<br>- <b>Weekday</b> - Multi-language support<br>\u2003- TAP to open Alarm<br>- <b>Daily steps goal % bar</b> - Syncs with the health app<br>\u2003- TAP to open Steps<br>- <b>Battery % bar<b> <br>\u2003- TAP to open Battery info<br>- <b>Battery and Steps can be hidden<b> <br>\u2003- TAP left screen edge (&quot;9 o&#39;clock&quot;) to hide/show<br>- <b>2 Custom app shortcuts</b> - Hidden<br>\u2003- Center of the watch face and Minutes<br>- <b>Battery efficient AOD</b> - Customizable<br>\u2003- Averaging just 2.5% - 4.5% active pixels<br><br>- <b>Long-press to access <u>Customize menu</u></b>:<br>\u2003\u2003- Seconds Brightness - 6 levels<br>\u2003\u2003- Index styles - 4 different styles<br>\u2003\u2003- AOD Cover - 4 cover options<br>\u2003\u2003- Complications<br>\u2003\u2003\u2003 - 2 Custom app shortcuts<br><br><br><b><font color=\"#00E8AD\">INSTALLATION TIPS:</font></b><br><b>https://www.enkeidesignstudio.com/how-to-install</b><br><br><br><b><font color=\"#00E8AD\">CONTACT:</font></b><br><b>info@enkeidesignstudio.com</b><br><br>E-mail us for any questions, issues or general feedback. <b>We&#39;re here for you!</b><br>Customer satisfaction is our main priority, we make sure to respond to each e-mail within <b>24 hours</b>. <br><br><br><b>More watch faces:</b><br>https://play.google.com/store/apps/dev?id=5744222018477253424<br><br><b>Website:</b><br>https://www.enkeidesignstudio.com<br><br><b>Social media:</b><br>https://www.facebook.com/enkei.design.studio<br>https://www.instagram.com/enkeidesign<br><br><br><b>This free version of ZION is also available in Samsung Galaxy Store, for older Samsung Galaxy Watch devices running Tizen OS:</b><br>https://galaxy.store/ZIONfree<br><br><br>Thank you for using our watch faces.<br>Have a great day!</b></b></b></b>",
